# dev: ripgrep defaults. Read through RIPGREP_CONFIG_PATH, set in fish.
#
# Smart case everywhere, hidden files skipped except the ones that matter, and a
# .gitignore-aware search that still finds things inside ignored build output
# when you ask with -uu.
--smart-case
--hidden
--glob=!.git/
--glob=!node_modules/
--glob=!target/
--glob=!dist/
--glob=!build/
--max-columns=200
--max-columns-preview
